</span></strong>. I really appreciate for taking time out of your busy schedule to <strong><span style=\\"color: #000000; line-height: 28px;\\">[insert content].</span></strong><br />We appreciate the opportunity to work with you and we''re grateful for the trust you''ve placed in us.&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"line-height: 200%;\\"><span face=\\"lucida sans unicode, lucida grande, sans-serif\\" style=\\"line-height: 28px;\\">Sender.name</span></p>", "_meta": {"htmlID": "u_content_text_1", "htmlClassNames": "u_content_text"}, "anchor": "", "locked": false, "fontSize": "14px", "hideable": true, "deletable": true, "draggable": true, "linkStyle": {"inherit": true, "linkColor": "#0000ee", "linkUnderline": true, "linkHoverColor": "#0000ee", "linkHoverUnderline": true}, "textAlign": "left", "_languages": {}, "lineHeight": "200%", "selectable": true, "_styleGuide": null, "hideDesktop": false, "duplicatable": true, "containerPadding": "10px", "displayCondition": null}}, {"id": "rxdZ8BvqMu", "type": "text", "values": {"text": "<div style=\\"color: #ffff00; line-height: 120%; padding: 25px 10px 10px;\\">\\n<div style=\\"line-height: 14px; color: #ffff00;\\">\\n<p style=\\"line-height: 140%; text-align: center; margin: 0px;\\"><span style=\\"line-height: 19.6px; color: #000000;\\"><strong><span style=\\"line-height: 19.6px;\\">Questions?</span></strong></span></p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"color: #989898; line-height: 200%; padding: 0px 20px;\\">\\n<div style=\\"line-height: 24px; color: #989898;\\">\\n<div style=\\"line-height: 24px; text-align: center;\\"><span style=\\"line-height: 19.6px;\\">Just reply to this email and we''ll get right back to you!</span></div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"color: #989898; line-height: 120%; padding: 10px;\\">\\n<div style=\\"line-height: 14px; color: #989898;\\">\\n<p style=\\"line-height: 140%; text-align: center; margin: 0px;\\"><span style=\\"line-height: 19.6px;\\">Find more answers in our <span style=\\"color: #00000